OL,5,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FMotorcyclist Danny is rushed into
OL,7,     Fthe emergency department following
OL,8,     Fa high-speed road traffic accident
OL,9,     Fin north Wales.
OL,10,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,11,     FAn aggressive patient is
OL,12,     Frestrained in Newham as Dr Nick
OL,13,     Forders ketamine sedation for a
OL,14,     Fhead injury. In Belfast, teenager
OL,15,     FJack suffers spinal shock after a
OL,16,     Fhorrific motorcycle crash.
OL,17,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,18,     FCan Dr Emma remove some cysts from
OL,19,     Fpatient Georgia's leg without them
OL,20,     Fexploding? Dr Adil Sheraz tackles
OL,21,     Flipomas and there's an
OL,22,     Feye-watering mole for Dr Dev Shah.
